"macOS protects system files, other users' data, Mail, Messages, Safari data, and Time Machine metadata behind Full Disk Access. Disk Map runs inside Continuum, so you grant this once to Continuum and every division shares it — there is no separate DiskScope permission. To index protected directories without access errors:" = "macOS 會將系統檔案、其他使用者的資料、Mail、Messages、Safari 資料以及 Time Machine 元資料置於完整磁碟取用權的保護之下。Disk Map 在 Continuum 內部執行，因此您只需為 Continuum 授權一次，所有分項即可共用此授權——並無獨立的 DiskScope 權限。若要在不發生存取錯誤的情況下為受保護的目錄建立索引：";
"Open System Settings → Privacy & Security → Full Disk Access." = "開啟系統設定 → 隱私權與安全性 → 完整磁碟取用權。";
"Click the + button (authenticate if asked) and add Continuum, or enable its toggle if it is already listed. (Remove any stale duplicate entries.)" = "點一下「+」按鈕（若有提示請完成驗證）並新增 Continuum，或若它已列在清單中，請開啟其切換開關。（請移除任何過期的重複項目。）";
"Quit and relaunch Continuum — access permissions are applied when the app starts." = "結束並重新開啟 Continuum——存取權限會在應用程式啟動時套用。";
"Disk Map only reads file names and sizes. It never opens file contents, writes nothing, and has no network access. Note: a small number of items owned by root may still be skipped even with Full Disk Access — FDA grants access to protected user data, not root privileges, so this is expected." = "Disk Map 僅讀取檔案名稱與大小，絕不會開啟檔案內容、不會寫入任何資料，也沒有網路存取權限。注意：即使已取得完整磁碟取用權，少數由 root 擁有的項目仍可能被略過——FDA 授予的是對受保護使用者資料的存取權，而非 root 權限，因此這是正常現象。";
"%@ system-protected items were skipped (owned by root). Continuum has Full Disk Access — these aren't reachable by any app without root, so this is normal." = "已略過 %@ 個受系統保護的項目（由 root 擁有）。Continuum 已取得完整磁碟取用權——這些項目在沒有 root 權限的情況下，任何應用程式都無法存取，因此這是正常的。";
"%@ items could not be read. Grant Continuum Full Disk Access for a complete picture." = "有 %@ 個項目無法讀取。請為 Continuum 授予完整磁碟取用權以取得完整資訊。";
"Showing all files. %@ root-locked items (red outline) can't be opened or modified without admin rights." = "目前顯示所有檔案。%@ 個受 root 鎖定的項目（紅色外框）在沒有管理員權限的情況下無法開啟或修改。";

